{"id":"564164660","kind":"article","title":"杏仁体可能涉及到奖励新奇的输入","author":"Edmund T. Rolls","original_authors":["Edmund T. Rolls"],"original_source_urls":["https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Amygdala_may_be_involved_in_rewarding_novel_input"],"publisher":"Jarrett Ye","column":"认知基石 & 教育培训","date":"2022-09-14","updated":"2022-09-14","votes":6,"comment_count":0,"minutes":1,"chars":395,"keywords":["杏仁核","新奇刺激","奖励机制","视觉输入"],"summary":"这条研究札记援引 Rolls 的文献指出，对视觉刺激有奖励反应的部分杏仁体神经元，也可能对相对新奇的视觉输入作出反应，并参与实现新奇刺激的奖励价值。","zhihu_url":"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/564164660","restoration":null,"toc":[],"html":"<p data-pid=\"fmfwf9yY\"> 一些对奖励视觉刺激有反应的杏仁体神经元也会对相对新奇的视觉刺激有反应。并且它们可能实现新奇刺激所具有的奖励价值（FAW Wilson &amp; ET Rolls, in preparation; Rolls 1999a, 2000b）</p><hr/><p data-pid=\"vO739ddB\">引用的摘录来自以下<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/References\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">参考资料</a>：</p><p data-pid=\"Cj-G8Ke8\">标题：<b>大脑中的记忆系统</b></p><p data-pid=\"bxZ-iI_r\">作者：Edmund T. Rolls</p><p data-pid=\"EY5oEjJL\">链接：<a class=\"external\" href=\"http://docplayer.net/46038895-Memory-systems-in-the-brain.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"invisible\">http://</span><span class=\"visible\">docplayer.net/46038895-</span><span class=\"invisible\">Memory-systems-in-the-brain.html</span><span class=\"ellipsis\"></span></a></p><p data-pid=\"CBhV-R1d\">反向链接：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Pleasure_of_learning\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">学习的乐趣</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup></p><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><blockquote data-pid=\"89CLKhui\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"http://paratranz.cn/projects/3131\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Thoughts Memo</a> 汉化组译制<br/>原文：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Amygdala_may_be_involved_in_rewarding_novel_input\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Am